Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?P15:=20daemon=20=E2=80=94=20per-dispatch=20rese?=
 =?UTF-8?q?t=20guard=20for=20wxLog=20+=20C=20locale?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
